1
00:00:01,910 --> 00:00:04,240
Open Profiles on the right-hand strip.

2
00:00:04,340 --> 00:00:13,490
Scalping is the profile in use. To remove it, first switch to another one.

3
00:00:13,590 --> 00:00:16,510
Click the cross beside a profile to delete it.

4
00:00:16,610 --> 00:00:21,010
It is deleted straight away, without a question, so check the name first.

